From: rolex bring-up <rolex@local>
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] tty: rpmsg_tty: klaim channel AT Qualcomm (DATA4/DATA1)

Modem MSM8917/MDM9607 mengumumkan channel AT sebagai "DATA4"/"DATA1". Dengan
menambahkannya di tabel id rpmsg_tty, channel itu menjadi tty (/dev/ttyRPMSGx)
yang bisa dipakai sms_tool, gcom, dan 3ginfo-lite.

--- a/drivers/tty/rpmsg_tty.c
+++ b/drivers/tty/rpmsg_tty.c
@@ -216,6 +216,9 @@
 
 static struct rpmsg_device_id rpmsg_driver_tty_id_table[] = {
 	{ .name	= "rpmsg-tty" },
+	/* Channel AT modem Qualcomm (MSM8917/MDM9607) -> /dev/ttyRPMSGx */
+	{ .name	= "DATA4" },
+	{ .name	= "DATA1" },
 	{ },
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(rpmsg, rpmsg_driver_tty_id_table);
